{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Resolve codec-framed error payloads before throwing.** This validates the envelope but never loads it or verifies its digest, leaving protocol data in `InvokeFailedException.errorData`. A handler catching the failure can therefore continue with an unavailable or tampered reference instead of seeing the target's serialized error. Resolve it through `PayloadCodec`, rebuild the `ErrorObject` with the restored data, and add reference-load and digest-failure tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7orenG","finding_digest":"984dfa8726ca1f47de5b42812def73ee52ab279b3ac2028aae5a469a31594f86","finding_id":"arf_v1_tbg7vbzgzipupxs3ikas333t5z","finding_key":"sdk/operation/invokeoperation::decode-framed-output::codec-envelope-validation","identity_key":"sdk/operation/invokeoperation::decode-framed-output::codec-envelope-validation","line":136,"observation_digest":"0d69732f6f462b9bb4b4aa8ebb82a0a88217c6e7c2699be67b766b9a830100ba","observation_id":"aro_v1_bvuxgl3piyvzxnfuvkhlxavavc","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/InvokeOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_tbg7vbzgzipupxs3ikas333t5z","published_at":"2026-09-01T11:39:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_wicvhchrpsxqbe7qse2qnnm7l4","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"c90ea8e743c766eb916df960a7a2f69bc41e3542","reviewer":"codex","start_line":132,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_k54s2aq6scc4pycqda476r6oxi","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T11:39:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
